## 3. Time Complexity

| Approach | Time Complexity | Space Complexity |
|---|---|---|
| While Loop | O(log₁₀ n) | O(1) |
| log10() Technique | O(1) | O(1) |

Here, n represents the input number. The logarithmic complexity comes from repeatedly removing one decimal digit.
